      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Importing from %@ (exported %@) will merge the file into your local data. Tasks and folders that share an ID with the file are replaced with the file's version; focus history is updated for days in the file. Local items not in the file are kept. Preferences are taken from the file. You'll be able to roll back from the Data section if needed.",
